(280, 1, '2025-12-19 09:00:22', '2025-12-19 02:00:22', '<p>Driven by innovation, shaped by passion, and dedicated to helping you unlock your full potential. Empowering coaches, educators, and learners with digital tools that transform growth.</p>			<h2>About US</h2>		<p>We are dedicated to delivering exceptional value through quality, innovation, and genuine care for our customers. What began as a simple idea has grown into a trusted brand committed to helping people achieve more every day.</p><ul role=\"list\"><li>Learn skills from industry experts</li><li>Study anytime, anywhere at convenience</li><li>Complete hands-on projects for mastery</li><li>Join a community to share knowledge</li></ul>					\n												<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_4_41)\"><path d=\"M13.3333 15.832C13.3333 15.2137 13.9442 14.2904 14.5625 13.5154C15.3575 12.5154 16.3075 11.6429 17.3967 10.977C18.2133 10.4779 19.2033 9.9987 20 9.9987M20 9.9987C19.2033 9.9987 18.2125 9.51953 17.3967 9.02036C16.3075 8.3537 15.3575 7.4812 14.5625 6.48286C13.9442 5.70703 13.3333 4.78203 13.3333 4.16536M20 9.9987L6.19245e-07 9.9987\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></g><defs><clipPath id=\"clip0_4_41\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"white\" transform=\"translate(8.74228e-07 20) rotate(-90)\"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg>			\n									Hubungi kami\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"880\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/lmswebsite/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Card-2.webp\" alt=\"\" />																<h3>Frequently Asked</h3>										<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_4_41)\"><path d=\"M13.3333 15.832C13.3333 15.2137 13.9442 14.2904 14.5625 13.5154C15.3575 12.5154 16.3075 11.6429 17.3967 10.977C18.2133 10.4779 19.2033 9.9987 20 9.9987M