ksgrove right at the coast</p>                        \n                <!-- .elementskit-card END -->', 'About', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '131-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-12-19 09:00:22', '2025-12-19 02:00:22', '', 131, 'http://localhost/wordpress/lmswebsite/?p=280', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
